This walkway was designed to help people traverse the fairgrounds, connecting the long distances between the pavilions. So in that sense, I mean, it definitely had a practical function. But very soon it was clear. that this was much more than that. It was really an attraction in its own ride. So it's something that people had never experienced anywhere. Paris's moving walkway was bigger and bolder than anything anyone had seen before.
这条人行道旨在帮助人们穿过展区，连接各个展馆之间的长距离。所以从这个意义上说，它绝对具有实际功能。但很快人们就清楚了，这远不止于此。它本身就是一种吸引力。这是人们在任何地方都从未体验过的。巴黎的移动人行道比任何人以前见过的都要宏大、大胆。

